/P 208 0 R
/E (Kalyani Government Engineering College \(KGEC\) was established by the Govt. of West Bengal in 1995. The college is affiliated with Maulana Abul Kalam Azad University of Technology \(formerly WBUT\), Kolkata, West Bengal. KGEC is among the top engineering colleges of West Bengal and one of the finest engineering institutes in the country. It is a community of learners, striving to educate the mind, nurture the spirit and foster the development of the whole individual.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
